    <tr>
     <td valign="top">
      <table width="590" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" align="center" style="line-height: 1.3em;">
       <tr>
        <td valign="top">
         <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#3e362a" size="3">
          <strong>Re: National Funding Agreement #{!Opportunity.Merchant_Number__c}</strong>
          <br><br>
          Your payment history on your National Funding Working Capital Loan qualifies you for more cash.  But time is running out for this special status.  <u>I can get you cash in 24 hours once I receive your updated bank statements</u>.
          <br><br>
          Small businesses are constantly challenged to find working capital.  We are a good and simple resource to get you the cash you need.  We helped you out before and we want to help you again. There's no telling when the need for cash will arise next.
          <br><br>
          <center><strong>Your last 6 months of bank statements are all I need!</strong></center>
          <br>
          <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#3e362a" size="3">
          Send your statements to my fax number listed below.  You could have funds loaded into your account in as few as 24 hours.  It's easy and quick.
          <br><br>
          However, we can only hold this offer open for a little more time so we encourage you to take advantage of this opportunity.
          <br><br>
          You may call me directly at <strong>{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep_Phone__c}</strong> to discuss how we can help you get more cash. I look forward to your call and assisting you in achieving your future business endeavors.
          <br><br>
          Sincerely,
          <br><br>
          {!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep__c}
                <br>
                Relationship Manager | <a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=Renewal%20Drip&utm_medium=Email&utm_content=HomeSig&utm_campaign=Renewal100Paid30Days{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep__c}" style="color: #b5121b; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"><Strong>National Funding</Strong></a>
                <br>
                <a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=Renewal%20Drip&utm_medium=Email&utm_content=HomeSig&utm_campaign=Renewal100Paid30Days{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep__c}" target="_blank"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001YmTe&oid=00D80000000diq5&lastMod=1345062060000" width="166" height="33" border="0" title="You may be eligible for additional cash. National Funding."></a>                </font></p>
          <p><font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#3e362a" size="3">{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep_Signature__c}
